# Git hooks and shell scripts must keep LF endings — a CRLF shebang
# (`#!/bin/sh\r`) makes the interpreter lookup fail on checkout (Windows
# autocrlf would otherwise convert them and silently break the hook).
hooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# GitHub Actions run: blocks are fed to bash on the Linux runner — a CRLF here
# appends \r to every script line and breaks it. Keep workflow YAML LF.
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
